msgctxt "236"
msgid "(Time to bring Ayako home. She must have gone downtown...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid "Huh? Where's Ayako?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid "Listen up everyone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid "What's going on, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "It's Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "Huh? What about her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid ""
"(These kids need to realize how much Ayako does for them.\r\n"
"I better talk to each of them one by one.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "(Now, who's up?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid ""
"Shiro. When you needed help with your homework last night,\r\n"
"who did you go to?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid "Huh? Ayako-chan, but..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"No buts. She had her own work to worry about, but she still\r\n"
"took the time to make sure you got the help you needed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "And what did you say to her today, Shiro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Mitsuo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Uh... yeah?"
msgstr "Uh... Sì."

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"Remember that fight you got in the other day? Do you know\r\n"
"who went to apologize to the boy's parents?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid "Wait, that was Ayako-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "That's right."
msgstr "Esatto."

msgctxt "500"
msgid "She didn't have to do that. It was just a little scuffle."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"A little scuffle that left the other boy with a broken bone.\r\n"
"He fractured one in his hand when he fell."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"Ayako's apology is the only thing that kept it from boiling\r\n"
"over into a much bigger issue."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"Oh... I guess that's why she kept telling me to go say I was\r\n"
"sorry..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid "Koji."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid "What, me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid ""
"You. Ayako always patches you up when you get hurt playing\r\n"
"baseball, right? How often do you thank her for that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Well, um..."
msgstr "Beh, ehm..."

msgctxt "620"
msgid "Taichi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid "What?"
msgstr "Cosa?"

msgctxt "644"
msgid "Remember when you collapsed from your buckwheat allergy?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "656"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Did you ever think about who rushed to call the doctor for you? It was "
"Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid "I..."
msgstr "Io..."

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Izumi."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "Uh-huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid ""
"Ayako gave you that 500 yen to buy a nice new toy for Mame.\r\n"
"How do you think she felt when you told her you just bought\r\n"
"candy for you and your friend instead?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "Um..."
msgstr "Ehm..."

msgctxt "764"
msgid "Eri."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid "Yeah...?"
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "788"
msgid ""
"You and Ayako had a fight the other day. But she didn't hold a grudge. She "
"forgave you right away and still treated you just the same as she always "
"does, didn't she?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Riona."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "Me? I didn't do anything."
msgstr "Non ho fatto niente."

msgctxt "848"
msgid "Who gave you those clothes?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Well, uh... It was Ayako-chan. So what?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"She got those for you because she knew how embarrassed you\r\n"
"were about the burn scar on your arm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Have you ever been that considerate toward any of the other\r\n"
"kids sitting at this table?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "Well..."
msgstr "Beh..."

msgctxt "932"
msgid ""
"I don't think you guys realize how much Ayako-chan does for\r\n"
"all of us. And you definitely aren't grateful for it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "944"
msgid "But we're a family, right? We should be there for each other."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "Agreed. Now... I'm going to find Ayako."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid ""
"It's okay. Uncle Kaz will bring her back and we can all show\r\n"
"just how much we appreciate her!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid "Hmm. What should we make for dinner tonight, Haruka-chan?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Good question... I wonder what the others feel like having."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid "Oh, Izumi-chan!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1076"
msgid ""
"Did you end up getting that new toy for Mame? He must have\r\n"
"been so happy when you brought it home for him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid "Oh, that? They were all sold out."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid "And what about the 500 yen I lent you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1112"
msgid "Me and my friend used it to buy some candy! It was soooooo good!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "What's wrong, Shiro? More homework?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "Nuh-uh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid ""
"I handed in the homework you helped me with yesterday, but\r\n"
"my teacher got real mad because it wasn't 400 words like he\r\n"
"said it should be. He gave me detention and everything!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid "Huh? I didn't realize it had to be a certain length..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid ""
"But it said it right in the top corner of the page!\r\n"
"Ugh, if you're gonna help, at least try to do it right!\r\n"
"I'm just gonna get even more grammar homework now..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid ""
"That's not very nice, Shiro! Ayako-chan took time out of her\r\n"
"night to help you! You should be grateful!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "Ayako-chan..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Hm? Ayako?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "Ayako-chan, wait!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "Haruka? What happened?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1304"
msgid "Well, um..."
msgstr "Beh, ehm..."

msgctxt "1352"
msgid "Wow, it got so late!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1364"
msgid "Heh, yeah. It's almost time for you kids to get to bed."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1376"
msgid ""
"I think I'm gonna take a bath first! Can you check on the\r\n"
"others for me while I'm in there, Uncle Kaz?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid ""
"Make sure they've all taken baths, and ask how their\r\n"
"homework's coming along while you're at it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "Heh, I think I can do that."
msgstr ""

